{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o090a","title":"曹操令郡国兴学","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o090a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操下令郡国修文学，满五百户之县置校官，选乡中俊才教学。","evidence":["wudi-e-o090a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"颁令兴学","evidence":["wudi-e-o090a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安八年秋七月","year":203,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o090a-q","wudi-q-o088","wudi-q-b-fa887192716200f6f3cb"],"chronology":"wudi-y203","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o088","basis":"建安八年秋七月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,491,"O090a"],"order":210}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o090a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9569c2e9d7bc71b7bd88","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，令曰：“丧乱以来，十有五年。后生者不见仁义礼让之风，吾甚伤之。其令郡国：各修文学〖1〗；县满五百户，置校官〖2〗，选其乡之俊造而教学之〖3〗。庶几先王之道不废〖4〗，而有以益于天下。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":490,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":481,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-09a0cf6c0d76993997e0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o088","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b55e52dce3d59a3bbee9","layer":"original","quote":"八年春三月〖2〗，攻其郭〖3〗；乃出战。击，大破之，谭、尚夜遁。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":477,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","not